The one-token option-logit readout follows the approach of NInfer
(https://github.com/igorls/ninfer, Apache-2.0); no NInfer code is included.
The calibration temperature was fitted on Cygnet's generated items
(calibration/items.jsonl in cygnet-recipe, MIT); calibration/ holds only the
model's scores on them, not the items. runs/ holds results produced by
JevBench (https://github.com/fstandhartinger/jevbench, MIT) on its public set.
